    "detailed_description": "<h1>Win a Free Steam Key!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think you're a tactical genius? Prove it and win a Steam Key!</strong><br><br>\ud83c\udfaf Show us your most effective or creative tactic in <i>Blitzkrieg Express</i><br>\ud83d\udcf8 Post a screenshot on Steam Community Hub or tag us on social media<br>\ud83c\udf81 Winners receive an <strong>extra Steam key</strong>! <br>\ud83d\udcc5 Deadline: <strong>July 31</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/1f653c7f1138676bd50fd8055e1f314e.avif?t=1752157952\" width=800 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/45965a84a095002dab0b3be9149c1c84.avif?t=1752157952\" width=707 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blitzkrieg Express</strong> is an explosive mix of shooter, puzzle, and survival. Your enemy \u2014 an armored train tearing through your land. Your mission \u2014 stop it at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/e22a2701c7fd1f98e04e8972457d28d2.poster.avif?t=1752157952\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/e22a2701c7fd1f98e04e8972457d28d2.webm?t=1752157952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/e22a2701c7fd1f98e04e8972457d28d2.mp4?t=1752157952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive and defend</strong> your land against the armored train in this arcade achievement-attack puzzle. Think smart, find the right sequence to create combos by destroying wagons with different bonuses to speed up and boost your cannon, and stop the train before it stops you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/10065b693df5fcabc7b1987c09ec5010.poster.avif?t=1752157952\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/10065b693df5fcabc7b1987c09ec5010.webm?t=1752157952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/10065b693df5fcabc7b1987c09ec5010.mp4?t=1752157952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for tactical train puzzles with unique wagons and effects, and 100+ thrilling levels.\u00a0</strong>Upgrade your cannon, choose your targets wisely \u2014 and take down the Armed Train General.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/54ba14e956b02d00a127803de89e67e3.poster.avif?t=1752157952\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/54ba14e956b02d00a127803de89e67e3.webm?t=1752157952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/54ba14e956b02d00a127803de89e67e3.mp4?t=1752157952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/45965a84a095002dab0b3be9149c1c84.avif?t=1752157952\" width=707 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blitzkrieg Express</strong> is an explosive mix of shooter, puzzle, and survival. Your enemy \u2014 an armored train tearing through your land. Your mission \u2014 stop it at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/e22a2701c7fd1f98e04e8972457d28d2.poster.avif?t=1752157952\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/e22a2701c7fd1f98e04e8972457d28d2.webm?t=1752157952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/e22a2701c7fd1f98e04e8972457d28d2.mp4?t=1752157952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive and defend</strong> your land against the armored train in this arcade achievement-attack puzzle. Think smart, find the right sequence to create combos by destroying wagons with different bonuses to speed up and boost your cannon, and stop the train before it stops you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/10065b693df5fcabc7b1987c09ec5010.poster.avif?t=1752157952\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/10065b693df5fcabc7b1987c09ec5010.webm?t=1752157952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/10065b693df5fcabc7b1987c09ec5010.mp4?t=1752157952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for tactical train puzzles with unique wagons and effects, and 100+ thrilling levels.\u00a0</strong>Upgrade your cannon, choose your targets wisely \u2014 and take down the Armed Train General.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/54ba14e956b02d00a127803de89e67e3.poster.avif?t=1752157952\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/54ba14e956b02d00a127803de89e67e3.webm?t=1752157952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/54ba14e956b02d00a127803de89e67e3.mp4?t=1752157952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
